{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/f4edb348f5150943a44b1d8cd559cc18.avif?t=1772667326\" width=498 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/66662168a72f8a4a8fb53b56eca64dd2.poster.avif?t=1772667326\" width=339 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/66662168a72f8a4a8fb53b56eca64dd2.webm?t=1772667326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your grandmother died, you were inconsolable. Now you just want to feel a bit closer to her. One mishap and you are stuck with your newly acquired ink friend and the magic found between the pages of your inherited books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/14d4ac97a5830da53e91ee6f7a61b95e.avif?t=1772667326\" width=498 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/34de358cc29dc77d056bea7f6284bd00.poster.avif?t=1772667326\" width=320 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/34de358cc29dc77d056bea7f6284bd00.webm?t=1772667326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three different diaries, each with a unique design and environment, solve puzzles, and collect pigments to make more ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/be6cbf781a699c05cc9c6f04a27c99de.avif?t=1772667326\" width=498 height=123 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a 2D, hand-drawn, escape room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New styles and environments with each book you crack open</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/47441aecfad6ef4aea2c950f9d1e6c07.poster.avif?t=1772667326\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/47441aecfad6ef4aea2c950f9d1e6c07.webm?t=1772667326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/extras/47441aecfad6ef4aea2c950f9d1e6c07.mp4?t=1772667326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the puzzles. Refill the ink. Rewrite your fate.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3005720?t=1772667326","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772667326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772667326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com